{{Quote|Hypori hosts a former Baktoid Armor droid factory that might date to ten or maybe as many as thirty standard years before the war. That facility is still more or less intact, possibly even operational, but everything around it&mdash;including a couple of newer, retrofitted structures&mdash;was laid to waste.|[[Galen Walton Erso]]|<ref name="Catalyst" />}}
Established by [[Techno Union]] [[foreman]] [[Wat Tambor]] on [[Hypori]] was a [[Baktoid Armor Workshop|Baktoid Armor]] [[droid]] [[factory]] that produced [[battle droid]]s for the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. After the war's end, however, the factory was transformed into a secret '''research station''' for the [[Galactic Empire]], one of many locations throughout [[the galaxy]] that played a role in [[Project Celestial Power]], an Imperial program that researched and developed various portions of the Empire's [[superweapon]], a mobile [[battle station]] later known as the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]].<ref name="Catalyst" />

